{"3049830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OUTTA HELL", "steam_appid": 3049830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTTA HELL</strong> throws you into the afterlife as Mono, a former bank robber now trapped in a corporate purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you’ll need firepower, cunning, and skill. Dive in <strong>guns blazing</strong>, slow down the chaos with <strong>time-bending combat</strong>, or move <strong>tactically through the shadows</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>haunting and ethereal dimensions</strong> filled with deadly foes, from hollow souls to military demons and corrupt CEOs. Tear down the corporations that rule the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down secrets, collect cash, and upgrade your skills and arsenal to become faster, stronger, and deadlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTTA HELL Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling, brutal combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow Mo - Bullet Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-body movement: slide, combat roll, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and upgrade weapons and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets, collectibles, and cash to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse, immersive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic physics for water, grass, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, ethereal aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hideout hub world to plan your next move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME IS IN ACTIVE DEVELOPMENT,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ALL CONTENT IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE</strong> <strong>AND NOT REPRESENTATIVE OF FINAL QUALITY</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTTA HELL</strong> throws you into the afterlife as Mono, a former bank robber now trapped in a corporate purgatory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you’ll need firepower, cunning, and skill. Dive in <strong>guns blazing</strong>, slow down the chaos with <strong>time-bending combat</strong>, or move <strong>tactically through the shadows</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>haunting and ethereal dimensions</strong> filled with deadly foes, from hollow souls to military demons and corrupt CEOs. Tear down the corporations that rule the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt down secrets, collect cash, and upgrade your skills and arsenal to become faster, stronger, and deadlier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OUTTA HELL Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling, brutal combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow Mo - Bullet Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-body movement: slide, combat roll, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and upgrade weapons and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets, collectibles, and cash to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse, immersive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic physics for water, grass, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, ethereal aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hideout hub world to plan your next move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME IS IN ACTIVE DEVELOPMENT,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ALL CONTENT IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE</strong> <strong>AND NOT REPRESENTATIVE OF FINAL QUALITY</strong></p>", "short_description": "OUTTA HELL is an action-packed FPS set in haunting dimensions of the afterlife. You're Mono — trapped in a corporate purgatory after a life of crime. Dive in guns blazing, slow down the chaos with time-bending combat, or move tactically through the shadows — hell won’t wait, and neither should you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049830/5d13188e0c6e22e138afd341eb6efdbaacbf48fb/header.jpg?t=1787780644", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049830/e68cf05bbc3d88cc092826d4ae51a53900ffc821/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787780644", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049830/e68cf05bbc3d88cc092826d4ae51a53900ffc821/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787780644", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Lake Vince"], "publishers": ["Lake Vince"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049830/7dac1c1db657096d8759fc83a37d8098e5f81fdf/ss_7dac1c1db657096d8759fc83a37d8098e5f81fdf.600x338.jpg?t=1787780644", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049830/7dac1c1db657096d87